    <li class="ab-r" style="--d:1"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M24 3l18 10.5v21L24 45 6 34.5v-21z"/><path d="M16 32c0-9 6-15 16-15 0 9-6 15-16 15zM16 32l9-9"/></svg><h3>Clean label</h3><p>No artificial sweeteners, thickeners or fillers. Just goat whey concentrate, natural vanilla and stevia leaf.</p></li>
    <li class="ab-r" style="--d:2"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M24 3l18 10.5v21L24 45 6 34.5v-21z"/><path d="M24 14c4 5 6.500 8.500 6.500 12a6.500 6.500 0 0 1-13 0c0-3.500 2.500-7 6.500-12z"/></svg><h3>Gut health built in</h3><p>A2 protein plus prebiotic oligosaccharides, because how you feel after your shake matters as much as the protein in it.</p></li>
